    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cronin Wall Properties are delighted to present No. 35 Elm Grove, Castlemartyr, to the market. This bright and well-presented property is situated within a mature and established residential development, offering well-proportioned accommodation. The property benefits from a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, with large glazed doors overlooking the rear garden. The abundance of natural light, neutral décor and contemporary flooring create a fresh and inviting living space, with excellent connection to the garden.\r\n\r\nElm Grove is located in the village of Castlemartyr, with a range of local amenities close by including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities. The village is also ideally positioned for access to the N25, providing convenient connections towards Cork City, Midleton and East Cork, while the nearby coastline and surrounding countryside provide a variety of options for leisure and recreation.\r\nNo. 35 Elm Grove offers well-presented accommodation in a convenient and established Castlemartyr location.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of: Entrance Hallway, W.C. Kitchen, Living Room, Bedroom, Bathroom, Spare Room, Master Bedroom and En-Suite. Room sizes are indicative only. Room sizes are indicative ONLY.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 1.61m x 3.87m Wooden flooring, Radiator, Light Fixture, Wall power sockets, Stairs with wooden railing, entrance to W.C.\r\n\r\nW.C. 3.92m x 5.51m w.h.b, wall mounted mirror, w.c.\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Area: 5.57m x 5.57m Light fixtures, Radiator, Wooden flooring, double doors leading to back garden, Fireplace, Kitchen access, Wall sockets.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.73m x 2.66m Built-in-storage units, Electric hob and oven unit, Wall mounted units, Sink, Washing Machine, Wall Sockets\r\n\r\nSpare Room: 2.53m x 2.67m Radiator, Wall sockets, Carpeted flooring\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.38m x 3.71m Overhead light fixture, Wardrobe, En-suite entrance, bed frame, Radiator.\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 2.45m x 0.98m Linoleum flooring, Shower tiling, Shower, w.h.b, w.c., wall mounted mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom: 2.92m x 2.67m Overhead light fixture, bed frame, Radiator, Wall power sockets.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.71m x 2.57m Linoleum flooring, Shower & Bath tiling, w.h.b, w.c., wall mounted mirror space, Radiator."
      },
